# Gannet Cliff's quest "The Quiet Choir" on its own, without the hymn sheet read first: gannet_cliff.play reads it on
# Effigy Shoals and then runs this; the plan's play runs this after Effigy Shoals' own play (the sheet already held).
island Gannet Cliff
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Quiet Choir
wait 3
expect hidden pitladder
walk -18 -54 to -18 -49 h=1
zone cliff_foot
expect step 1
read Choir notice board
expect step 2
# (10-25: the cliff path dug as an even slope, 0.31 m per metre; the walker measured 7.2 m at z -30, 11.5 m at z -16)
walk -18 -44 to -18 -30 h=7.2
walk -18 -30 to -18 -16 h=11.5
walk -18 -16 to -18 -6 to -8 -4 h=13
zone tents
expect step 3
read Sister Ro
read Brother Ansel
read The Listener
expect story diary 3
expect step 4
use campbell
expect message nobody would come
use pitgate
expect shown pitladder
expect story pitopen 1
expect step 5
zone pit_floor
expect step 6
kill Hyena
expect step 7
use sermonradio
expect story sermon 1
expect step 8
zone hillfoot
expect step 9
zone hilltop
expect step 10
read Watcher Gideon Pell's log
expect step 11
open Far ear box
expect story strongkey 1
expect step 12
zone eggstore
expect step 13
air eggair
read Egg collector Wilf Darrow's note
expect step 14
zone kennelcave
read Dog keeper Mags Tolley's note
open Kennel box
expect step 14
zone pit_floor
open Listener's strongbox
expect story quarrychart 1
expect step 16
use campbell
expect story rung 1
expect done
storespot 11 -3
